Package: pandor
Type: Package
Title: Query 'pando' Corpus Indexes from R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Maarten", "Janssen", email = "janssen@ufal.mff.cuni.cz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs pando CQL queries through the 'pando' command-line program and returns
    counts and hit tables as data frames, ready for analysis and plotting (e.g. with ggplot2).
    The R counterpart of the Python package 'pando_cql': no compiled code, only the 'pando'
    binary and a pando corpus index are needed.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: ggplot2, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: pando (the 'pando' command-line program, on PATH or in PANDO_BIN)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
